===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# {{lb|en||Philippines|India|dated|_|in|_|North America|colloquial|informal}} A [[photocopy]].
#: {{ux|en|Hand me that '''xerox''', would you?}}
#* {{quote-book|en|author=David Ebershoff|title=w:The 19th Wife|year=2009|publisher=Random House|page=142|pageurl=https://archive.org/details/19thwifenovel00eber_0/page/142/mode/1up|isbn=978-0-8129-7415-7|passage=There were twenty pictures in the envelope, '''xeroxes''' but clear enough. They documented the scene pretty much as I imagined it.}}
